* AD8092 Non-Inverting Amplifier
.lib ADI.lib

* Power Supplies
VCC VCC 0 5V
VEE VEE 0 -5V

* Input Signal: 100 mV amplitude sine at 1 MHz
VIN IN 0 SINE(0 100mV 1Meg) AC 1

* Amplifier Circuit (Gain = 1 + RF/RG = 5)
X1 IN VN VCC VEE OUT AD8092
RF OUT VN 1k
RG VN 0 250
RL OUT 0 1k

* Simulation Directives
.tran 0 10u
.ac dec 20 10k 10Meg

* Measurements for Gain (Peak-to-Peak to reject DC offset)
.measure tran vout_max MAX V(OUT) from=5u to=10u
.measure tran vout_min MIN V(OUT) from=5u to=10u
.measure tran vin_max MAX V(IN) from=5u to=10u
.measure tran vin_min MIN V(IN) from=5u to=10u
.measure tran gain_db param 20*log10((vout_max-vout_min)/(vin_max-vin_min))

.end
